<questions><question-record><question>Dva ronioca nalaze &amp;#x003C;img src=&quot;scuba.png&quot; alt=&quot;scuba.png&quot; title=&quot;scuba&quot; width=&quot;450&quot; height=&quot;350&quot; style=&quot;display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;&quot;/&amp;#x003E;se u moru. Ronilac A je na dubini od 10 metara, a ronilac B na dubini od 20 metara. Kako se odnose hidrostatski tlakovi koje oni osje&amp;#x0107;aju?</question><clue></clue><category></category><weighting>100</weighting><fixed>0</fixed><question-type>1</question-type><answers><answer><text>Ronilac B osje&amp;#x0107;a dvostruko ve&amp;#x0107;i tlak od ronioca A.</text><feedback>Hidrostatski tlak je proporcionalan dubini teku&amp;#x0107;ine, pa dvostruko ve&amp;#x0107;a dubina zna&amp;#x010D;i dvostruko ve&amp;#x0107;i tlak.</feedback><correct>1</correct><percent-correct>100</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Ronilac A osje&amp;#x0107;a dvostruko ve&amp;#x0107;i tlak od ronioca B.</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Oba ronioca osje&amp;#x0107;aju isti tlak.</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text></text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer></answers></question-record><question-record><question>Koja je osnovna m&amp;#x003C;img src=&quot;Blaise_pascal.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Blaise_pascal.jpg&quot; title=&quot;Blaise_pascal&quot; width=&quot;300&quot; height=&quot;314&quot; style=&quot;display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;&quot;/&amp;#x003E;jerna jedinica za tlak u Me&amp;#x0111;unarodnom sustavu jedinica (SI)?</question><clue></clue><category></category><weighting>100</weighting><fixed>0</fixed><question-type>1</question-type><answers><answer><text>Newton (N)</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Bar (bar)</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Paskal (Pa)</text><feedback>Paskal je slu&amp;#x017E;bena jedinica za tlak nazvana po Blaiseu Pascalu. Definira se kao N/m^2</feedback><correct>1</correct><percent-correct>100</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text></text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer></answers></question-record><question-record><question>Atmosferski tlak uzrokuje?&amp;#x003C;img src=&quot;kako-nas-atmosfera-stiti.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;kako-nas-atmosfera-stiti.jpg&quot; title=&quot;kako-nas-atmosfera-stiti&quot; width=&quot;450&quot; height=&quot;350&quot; style=&quot;display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;&quot;/&amp;#x003E;</question><clue></clue><category></category><weighting>100</weighting><fixed>0</fixed><question-type>1</question-type><answers><answer><text>Mjesec</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Sunce</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Zemljina gravitacija i zrak</text><feedback>Zrak pod djelovanjem gravitacije stvara tlak.</feedback><correct>1</correct><percent-correct>100</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Ni&amp;#x0161;ta od navedenog</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer></answers></question-record><question-record><question>Tri posude potpuno razli&amp;#x010D;itog oblika napunjene su vodom do jednake visine h. Dna svih triju posuda imaju potpuno istu povr&amp;#x0161;inu A. Kakav je hidrostatski tlak vode na dno tih posuda?&amp;#x003C;img src=&quot;en-liquids-hydrostatic-pressure-water-vessel-shape.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;en-liquids-hydrostatic-pressure-water-vessel-shape.jpg&quot; title=&quot;en-liquids-hydrostatic-pressure-water-vessel-shape&quot; width=&quot;450&quot; height=&quot;350&quot; style=&quot;display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;&quot;/&amp;#x003E;</question><clue></clue><category></category><weighting>100</weighting><fixed>0</fixed><question-type>1</question-type><answers><answer><text>Najve&amp;#x0107;i je tlak u onoj posudi koja zbog svog oblika sadr&amp;#x017E;i najve&amp;#x0107;u masu vode.</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Najve&amp;#x0107;i tlak je u naju&amp;#x017E;oj posudi.</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Tlak na dno je svugdje jednak.</text><feedback>Hidrostatski tlak ovisi o gusto&amp;#x0107;i teku&amp;#x0107;ine i dubini tj. visini stupca. Oblik posude je nebitan.</feedback><correct>1</correct><percent-correct>100</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>Premalo informacija da bi donijeli zaklju&amp;#x010D;ak.</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer></answers></question-record><question-record><question>Na mali klip hidrauli&amp;#x010D;ke dizalice djeluje sila od 100 N, a povr&amp;#x0161;ina klipa iznosi 0,02 m&amp;#x00B2;. Povr&amp;#x0161;ina velikog klipa iznosi 0,20 m&amp;#x00B2;. Kolika sila djeluje na veliki klip?&amp;#x003C;img src=&quot;hyd.png&quot; alt=&quot;hyd.png&quot; title=&quot;hyd&quot; width=&quot;450&quot; height=&quot;345&quot; style=&quot;display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;&quot;/&amp;#x003E;</question><clue></clue><category></category><weighting>100</weighting><fixed>0</fixed><question-type>1</question-type><answers><answer><text>100 N</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>0.1 N</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>10000 N</text><feedback></feedback><correct>0</correct><percent-correct>0</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer><answer><text>1000 N</text><feedback>Prema formuli F1/A1 = F2/A2</feedback><correct>1</correct><percent-correct>100</percent-correct><include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options></answer></answers></question-record></questions>
</data>

